==API==
====Changes====
* The [[Getting_the_current_interface_number|TOC version]] is <code>80200</code>
* No files outside of <code>Interface\</code> can be addressed by file path anymore
:* {{api|GetFileIDFromPath}}() will no longer work for non-interface file paths. <ref>TSquare 2019-04-23. IRC #wowuidev</ref>
:* Paths to <code>Fonts\</code> are still accessible for [[API FontInstance SetFont|FontInstance:SetFont]]()
:* Sounds cannot be replaced anymore by dropping a sound file in the <code>Sound\</code> folder, but they can still be (un)muted with {{api|MuteSoundFile}}() and {{api|UnmuteSoundFile}}().
* {{api|C_ReportSystem.InitiateReportPlayer}}() and {{api|C_ReportSystem.SendReportPlayer}}() were protected to prevent automating reports, addons have to use {{api|C_ReportSystem.OpenReportPlayerDialog}}() now. <ref>TSquare 2019-04-24. IRC #wowuidev</ref>
* Nameplates anchoring is now restricted to only those in the same anchor "family". This was done to disable drawing lines to nameplates. <ref>TSquare 2019-05-16. IRC #wowuidev</ref>
* [[API_GameTooltip_AddTexture|GameTooltip:AddTexture]]() now supports multiple customizable textures per line.
* The [https://www.townlong-yak.com/framexml/8.1.5/WorldStateFrame.lua WorldStateFrame] widget functionality was replaced by the [[World_of_Warcraft_API#UI_Widget_Manager|UI Widget Manager]] API.
* {{api|ShowUIPanel}}() and {{api|HideUIPanel}}() are now protected, they can no longer be called by addons while in combat.
* [[MACRO_framestack|/fstack]] doesn't show the global frame names anymore unless disabling the {{api|t=c|fstack_preferParentKeys}} CVar.
* Deprecated API: [https://www.townlong-yak.com/framexml/8.2.0/Blizzard_Deprecated/Deprecated_8_2_0.lua Blizzard_Deprecated 8.2.0]
 
 
